abstract: >-
  NPAP is an open-source Python library for partitioning and aggregating
  network graphs, with a focus on electrical power systems. Built on NetworkX,
  it provides a strategy-based architecture for reducing the spatial complexity
  of networks while preserving their essential physical properties.

repository-code: "https://github.com/IEE-TUGraz/NPAP"
